    "en": {
      "name": "Sportsdragon Connection",
      "effect": "Special Summon 1 Level 5-6 Dragon Type Normal Monster from your hand or Graveyard face-up to your field. Then, if you have \"Sportsdragon Keeper\" face-up on your field, you can add 1 \"Sportsdragon Striker\" or \"Sportsdragon Defender\" from your Graveyard to your hand."
